SOLUTION 0 Infilling
    pH 7.0 charge
    Na 1.0
    Cl 1.0

SOLUTION 1-10 Initial
    pH 7.0 charge
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0

EXCHANGE 1-10
    X- 0.001

EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1-10
    Calcite 0 0

TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
    -time_step 1
    -flow_direction forward
    -boundary_conditions constant constant
    -lengths 1*1
    -dispersivities 0
    -correct_disp false
    -print_cells 3
    -print_frequency 1
    -punch_cells 3
    -punch_frequency 1

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selout.txt
    -reset false
    -time true
    -solution true
    -totals Na
    -activities Na+
